The strategy is H-009 plus the one added regime condition, as the proposal states. Entry also requires SMA(2160) at bar t to be above SMA(2160) at t−720. `startup_candle_count` is 2880, the proposal''s warm-up and the history that slope needs. I changed no existing files.

